abstract: "Code and author-derived evaluation data for cross-border synchronous high net load monitoring, including the selective-review revision analyses. Software is MIT licensed; derived data and retained third-party terms are described in DATA_LICENSES.md. The portable reconstruction verifies issued-forecast scores, forecast-only review plans, intact event processes and block-bootstrap comparisons without refitting models or asserting historical real-time availability."
